Serein AI Translate Extension
=============================

This project is a fork of Serein (https://github.com/ViceVerse-cz/Serein),
Copyright the Serein authors, licensed under Apache-2.0 (and MIT where dual
licensed). The translation layer added by this fork is likewise Apache-2.0.

This fork is designed to run alongside LTEngine, the LibreTranslate project's
llama.cpp inference server (AGPL-3.0). LTEngine is invoked over HTTP as a
separate process and is not linked, bundled or redistributed here. Model
weights (gemma3) are downloaded by the user directly from Hugging Face under
Google's model license.
